// v9.14 diagnostic (gate-by-gate labels) removed after use — it did its job: on real 1-min data
// (UPL + SONA BLW, full sessions) EVERY bloomingCandle bar showed "BURST✗". The confluence gates
// (RSI/Vol/EMA/ADX/VWAP) were never even reached — the 1.5x/2x bar-over-bar histogram RATIO itself
// is the sole blocker. See v9.15 note at the top of CHANGE HISTORY for the fix once approved.
// Clean entry+type markers for historical review are the existing MDR (orange) / CONT (purple)
// label.new + plotshape blocks above (LABELS section) — those already show entry + entry_type
// exactly like the old v9.12 chart did; nothing new needed there once the burst ratio is fixed.
